import Mathlib

/-! Radius internalization, HM data: the explicit `U₇` correspondence of `X₀(7)`.

* `eK k X` (`k = 1..7`): the elementary symmetric functions of the seven branches
  `x((τ+j)/7)` as polynomials in `X = x(τ)`; `psi Y X = Σ (-1)^k eK k X Y^(7-k)`.
* `pM m X` (`m = 1..7`): the power sums `Σ_j x((τ+j)/7)^m = 7 U₇(x^m)`.
* `qM m i`: the coefficients of the level-one trace `Tr((49x)^{-m}) = Σ_i qM m i · j^i`.

All identities below are exact polynomial identities checked by `ring` (no numerics). Their
modular meaning is established in `Radius49U7Analytic`. -/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option linter.style.longLine false
namespace Zeta7Radius49

